{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny Monster Haven is an idle creature collector that sits on the side of your screen allowing you to go about your day while having cute monster companions roaming around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669020/extras/000be23786d71529e05fbb1e42a25477.avif?t=1757245550\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669020/extras_big/000be23786d71529e05fbb1e42a25477.avif?t=1757245550 width=800 height=276 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your Starter:</strong><br>Take on your role as monster caretaker by hatching your first monster companion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669020/extras/c84e260101c836491228cb69c58ddff9.avif?t=1757245550\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669020/extras_big/c84e260101c836491228cb69c58ddff9.avif?t=1757245550 width=800 height=466 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow crops:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant various types of crops and watch them grow while you play with your monsters. Once they're ready you can harvest and feed them to your monsters to improve their stats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cook delicious meals:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spoil your monsters by cooking them a variety of tasty snacks and meals! These delightful treats will further boost and level-up your monster's skills, making them more effective in combat. Each meal will boost different stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669020/extras/187862c8223d8392940dca0c521be347.poster.avif?t=1757245550\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669020/extras/187862c8223d8392940dca0c521be347.webm?t=1757245550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669020/extras/187862c8223d8392940dca0c521be347.mp4?t=1757245550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle wild monsters:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wild monsters will regularly show up to challenge your monsters to a duel. Engage them in tactical turn-based combat and defeat them to earn coins, experience and Monster Essence! Collect enough Monster Essence to get new monster eggs for your Haven! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each monster will help out in various ways: water monsters will water crops, insect monsters will pollinate crops yielding more harvest, fire monsters can boost the cooking pot to improve cook times, and more! <br>You can do the battles manually or enable an auto-battle option.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minigames:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter your monsters into various minigames such as the race course to see if they can out-perform their wild opponents!\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669020/extras/6e1ec6ca09e5a616bcb7e3e9df4d25f3.poster.avif?t=1757245550\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669020/extras/6e1ec6ca09e5a616bcb7e3e9df4d25f3.webm?t=1757245550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669020/extras/6e1ec6ca09e5a616bcb7e3e9df4d25f3.mp4?t=1757245550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669020/extras/8f157bb9e8d4f76a2ac77527475c9102.poster.avif?t=1757245550\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669020/extras/8f157bb9e8d4f76a2ac77527475c9102.webm?t=1757245550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669020/extras/8f157bb9e8d4f76a2ac77527475c9102.mp4?t=1757245550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate and expand your Tiny Monster Haven:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liven up your cozy Haven by purchasing beautiful decorations such as flowers, rocks, bushes and trees. When things start to get crowded you can purchase additional land and unlock new decorations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy</strong>\u00a0<strong>Seasons, dynamic weather, day/night cycle:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the passing of the 4 seasons with your monsters. Each season has its own weather patterns such as rain or snow.\u00a0Be on the lookout for certain wild monsters that only appear at specific seasons or at certain times of the day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669020/extras/b430d956324a1559154bfd4f0d3a9dbd.poster.avif?t=1757245550\" width=600 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669020/extras/b430d956324a1559154bfd4f0d3a9dbd.webm?t=1757245550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669020/extras/b430d956324a1559154bfd4f0d3a9dbd.mp4?t=1757245550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tweak your experience:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easily change the size and position of your Haven and choose if it should stick to the right or left side of the screen. You can also set the game to use a different monitor.  <br>There are also plenty of music and audio settings: tweak music volume, enable/disable weather sfx and mute or enable battle music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669020/extras/0a8e2e5fec7b010345755bdd6e63e1d3.avif?t=1757245550\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669020/extras_big/0a8e2e5fec7b010345755bdd6e63e1d3.avif?t=1757245550 width=800 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3669020?t=1757245550","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669020/c5fb2e2b74c1f6d855d3b103b2156a3ff44fa5e6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757245550","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669020/26a64c0a2b5cdc491ee9c100f6711c3cd933b52d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757245550","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669020/26a64c0a2b5cdc491ee9c100f6711c3cd933b52d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757245550","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid"