b7e3e9df4d25f3.mp4?t=1757245550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669020/extras/8f157bb9e8d4f76a2ac77527475c9102.poster.avif?t=1757245550\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669020/extras/8f157bb9e8d4f76a2ac77527475c9102.webm?t=1757245550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669020/extras/8f157bb9e8d4f76a2ac77527475c9102.mp4?t=1757245550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate and expand your Tiny Monster Haven:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liven up your cozy Haven by purchasing beautiful decorations such as flowers, rocks, bushes and trees. When things start to get crowded you can purchase additional land and unlock new decorations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy</strong>\u00a0<strong>Seasons, dynamic weather, day/night cycle:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the passing of the 4 seasons with your monsters. Each season has its own weather patterns such as rain or snow.\u00a0Be on the lookout for certain wild monsters that only appear at specific seasons or at certain times of the day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669020/extras/b430d956324a1559154bfd4f0d3a9dbd.poster.avif?t=1757245550\" width=600 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669020/extras/b430d956324a1559154bfd4f0d3a9dbd.webm?t=1757245550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669020/extras/b430d95632